codes.html#observation-pghd-codes-rockClimbing\">rockClimbing</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Rock climbing</td><td>The constant for rock climbing.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-observation-pghd-codes.html#observation-pghd-codes-rollerHockey\">rollerHockey</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Roller hockey</td><td>The constant for roller hockey.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-observation-pghd-codes.html#observation-pghd-codes-rowingMachine\">rowingMachine</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Rowing machine</td><td>The constant for rowing machine.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-observation-pghd-codes.html#observation-pghd-codes-runningTreadmill\">runningTreadmill</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Running treadmill</td><td>The constant for running treadmill.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-observation-pghd-codes.html#observation-pghd-codes-scubaDiving\">scubaDiving</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Scuba diving</td><td>The constant for scuba diving.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-observation-pghd-codes.html#observation-pghd-codes-skiing\">skiing</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Skiing</td><td>The constant for skiing.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-observation-pghd-codes.html#observation-pghd-codes-snowshoeing\">snowshoeing</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Snowshoeing</td><td>The constant for snowshoeing.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-observation-pghd-codes.html#observation-pghd-codes-squat\">squat</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Squat</td><td>The constant for squat.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-observation-pghd-codes.html#observation-pghd-codes-strengthTraining\">strengthTraining</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Strength training</td><td>The constant for strength training.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-observation-pghd-codes.html#observation-pghd-codes-stretching\">stretching</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Stretching</td><td>The constant for stretching.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-observation-pghd-codes.html#observation-pghd-codes-swimmingOpenWater\">swimmingOpenWater</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Swimming open water</td><td>The constant for swimming open water.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-observation-pghd-codes.html#observation-pghd-codes-swimmingPool\">swimmingPool</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Swimming pool</td><td>The constant for swimming pool.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-observation-pghd-codes.html#observation-pghd-codes-upperTwist\">upperTwist</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Upper twist</td><td>The constant for upper twist.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-observation-pghd-codes.html#observation-pghd-codes-weightlifting\">weightlifting</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Weightlifting</td><td>The constant for weightlifting.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-observation-pghd-codes.html#observation-pghd-codes-wheelchair\">wheelchair</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Wheelchair</td><td>The constant for wheelchair.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-observation-pghd-codes.html#observation-pghd-codes-workout\">workout</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Workout</td><td>The constant for workout.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-observation-pghd-codes.html#observation-pghd-codes-armCurl\">armCurl</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Arm curl</td><td>The constant for arm curl exercises targeting the biceps.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-observation-pghd-codes.html#observation-pghd-codes-ballSlam\">ballSlam</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Ball slam</td><td>The constant for full-body workouts using a slam ball.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-observation-pghd-codes.html#observation-pghd-codes-doubleArmTricepsExtension\">doubleArmTricepsExtension</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Double arm triceps extension</td><td>The constant for triceps extension exercises using both arms.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-observation-pghd-codes.html#observation-pghd-codes-dumbbellRow\">dumbbellRow</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Dumbbell row</td><td>The constant for back-strengthening exercises using dumbbells.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-observation-pghd-codes.html#observation-pghd-codes-frontRaise\">frontRaise</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Front raise</td><td>The constant for shoulder workouts lifting weights in front of the body.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-observation-pghd-codes.html#observation-pghd-codes-hipThrust\">hipThrust</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Hip thrust</td><td>The constant for glute-focused exercises involving hip elevation.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-observation-pghd-codes.html#observation-pghd-codes-hulaHoop\">hulaHoop</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Hula hoop</td><td>The constant for core and cardio workouts using a hula hoop.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-observation-pghd-codes.html#observation-pghd-codes-kettlebellSwing\">kettlebellSwing</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Kettlebell swing</td><td>The constant for dynamic full-body workouts using a kettlebell.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-observation-pghd-codes.html#observation-pghd-codes-lateralRaise\">lateralRaise</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Lateral raise</td><td>The constant for shoulder workouts lifting weights to the sides.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-observation-pghd-codes.html#observation-pghd-codes-legCurl\">legCurl</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Leg curl</td><td>The constant for hamstring-focused leg curl exercises.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-observation-pghd-codes.html#observation-pghd-codes-legExtension\">legExtension</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Leg extension</td><td>The constant for quadriceps-focused leg extension exercises.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-observation-pghd-codes.html#observation-pghd-codes-legPress\">legPress</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Leg press</td><td>The constant for lower-body strength training using a leg press machine.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-observation-pghd-codes.html#observation-pghd-codes-legRaise\">legRaise</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Leg raise</td><td>The constant for abdominal and hip flexor exercises involving leg lifts.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-observation-pghd-codes.html#observation-pghd-codes-mountainClimber\">mountainClimber</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Mountain climber</td><td>The constant for cardio and core workouts simulating climbing motion.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-observation-pghd-codes.html#observation-pghd-codes-otherWorkout\">otherWorkout</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Other workout</td><td>The constant for workouts not categorized under specific types.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-observation-pghd-codes.html#observation-pghd-codes-pause\">pause</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Pause</td><td>The constant for temporary pauses during a workout session.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-observation-pghd-codes.html#observation-pghd-codes-pullUp\">pullUp</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Pull-up</td><td>The constant for upper-body strength exercises involving pulling up the body.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-observation-pghd-codes.html#observation-pghd-codes-punch\">punch</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Punch</td><td>The constant for boxing-style workouts involving punching motions.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-observation-pghd-codes.html#observation-pghd-codes-rest\">rest</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Rest</td><td>The constant for rest periods between or after workouts.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-observation-pghd-codes.html#observation-pghd-codes-shoulderPress\">shoulderPress</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Shoulder press</td><td>The constant for overhead pressing exercises targeting the shoulders.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-observation-pghd-codes.html#observation-pghd-codes-singleArmTricepsExtension\">singleArmTricepsExtension</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Single arm triceps extension</td><td>The constant for triceps extension exercises using one arm.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-observation-pghd-codes.html#observation-pghd-codes-sitUp\">sitUp</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Sit-up</td><td>The constant for abdominal exercises involving torso lifts.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-observation-pghd-codes.html#observation-pghd-codes-stairClimbingMachine\">stairClimbingMachine</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Stair climbing</td><td>The constant for workouts using a stair climbing machine.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-observation-pghd-codes.html#observation-pghd-codes-swimmingBackstroke\">swimmingBackstroke</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Swimming backstroke</td><td>The constant for swimming using the backstroke technique.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-observation-pghd-codes.html#observation-pghd-codes-swimmingBreaststroke\">swimmingBreaststroke</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Swimming breaststroke</td><td>The constant for swimming using the breaststroke technique.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-observation-pghd-codes.html#observation-pghd-codes-swimmingButterfly\">swimmingButterfly</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Swimming butterfly</td><td>The constant for swimming using the butterfly stroke.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-observation-pghd-codes.html#observation-pghd-codes-swimmingFreestyle\">swimmingFreestyle</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Swimming freestyle</td><td>The constant for swimming using the freestyle stroke.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-observation-pghd-codes.html#observation-pghd-codes-swimmingMixed\">swimmingMixed</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Swimming mixed</td><td>The constant for swimming using a combination of strokes.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-observation-pghd-codes.html#observation-pghd-codes-swimmingOther\">swimmingOther</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Swimming other</td><td>The constant for swimming using other or unspecified techniques.</td></tr></table></li></ul></div>"^^rdf:XMLLiteral ]
